n>: And?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: He used to work as a security guard there.<br>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le03ob04re2img12.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's pretty cool. I bet he's got a few stories.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: He was locking up late at night when suddenly he heard footsteps.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Scary! Who was it?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: In the shadows, a menacing figure stood in the doorway.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How terrifying! I would be out of there so fast!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: He said that he dropped his keys and was paralysed with fear.<br>", "id": 2, "time": "16750", "image": "engenn5le03ob04re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What happened?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Eventually, the dark figure slowly dragged itself down the corridor.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Does he know what or who it was?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Later, his supervisor said that Tsar Ivan the Terrible haunts the Bell Tower.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I would never go back to work!<br>", "id": 3, "time": "39000", "image": "engenn5le03ob04re2img06.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}